{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>25歲前港姐季軍王敏慈近日在社交平台分享煞科花絮及一條極度性感的日落短片，其超高顏值與豐滿身材瞬間成為全網焦點 …</p><p></p>\n<p>25歲前港姐季軍王敏慈近日在社交平台分享煞科花絮及一條極度性感的日落短片，其超高顏值與豐滿身材瞬間成為全網焦點。這位剛畢業並準備在演藝圈大展拳腳的新星，過去卻曾被資深前輩公開狠批缺乏家教。這段鮮為人知的新舊世代交鋒往事其實暗藏著一段令人意想不到內幕。</p>\n<h2>前港姐季軍低胸裝上陣大派粉絲福利</h2>\n<p>王敏慈早前完成古裝劇《鳳隱朱牆》拍攝工作後火速更新社交平台，發布多張穿著淡綠色古裝長袍煞科花絮照片回饋支持者。除了仙氣滿溢古裝打扮，她更上載了一段在黃昏晚霞下拍攝戶外短片，片中她換上一襲牛油果綠色抹胸連衣裙。在超近特寫鏡頭下，貼身低胸剪裁將她深邃事業線與傲人上圍展露無遺，加上微風吹拂秀髮畫面極具視覺衝擊力。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361439132023162_724334706ae86237878b1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"_YXsTY-eiZNR3vpbMxrPjLV6jFH_rUeiBItlUgSLZVI.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361439132023162_724334706ae86237878b1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361439370449508_6663597756ae86239d7451.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"zNRytxBc76sTqsRKa_Xmp1-6dEBpN24Rp6RAOKekQDg.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361439370449508_6663597756ae86239d7451.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361439662812026_20617846476ae8623ccbc70.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"JPT-XCs9CVps2pjUUxS3Sfr9n56i2zmdkM0zqJDNM6g.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361439662812026_20617846476ae8623ccbc70.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361439878112373_6461798276ae8623f1f9cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ql8vrK1tvxQmtKmA8BGH36eoH-2b3ZwKUYPX81GD1_M.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361439878112373_6461798276ae8623f1f9cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361440154458286_1771217946ae86241bf065.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"dR5X0TC3TBmM49ZckHRQ19a6SDbbtxxSUElX1FBJV9Q.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361440154458286_1771217946ae86241bf065.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>王敏慈親筆信回應資深演員江美儀教導</h2>\n<p>擁有完美外表背後，原來她早前曾捲入一場前輩批評風波，資深演員江美儀曾在網上節目直指新一代藝人在被寵壞環境下長大。江美儀當時透露曾當面提醒一位港姐連拿筷子姿勢都出錯，直言演繹有教養角色沒理由不懂拿筷子，其後證實該名港姐正是王敏慈。面對前輩嚴厲批評，她事後以親筆手寫信致謝，信中寫道「我真的沒想到自己二十多年都不會拿的筷子居然學會了」，展現出極高情商與虛心受教態度。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178565322962965256_14613180046a6ee7edeb44b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-602TVBUSA-YouTube-1’16”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178565322962965256_14613180046a6ee7edeb44b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>曾與江美儀共同主持《大灣美味好玩攻略》港姐季軍王敏慈主動出面澄清。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178565322732149633_21277681686a6ee7eba6412.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_6303127788835246988_y.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178565322732149633_21277681686a6ee7eba6412.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>王敏慈在社交平台上載一封致江美儀親筆手寫信，信中大讚對方私底下是一位敬業又美麗大姐姐。（圖片來源：微博圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>參演《雨霖鈴》等多套劇集北上發展</h2>\n<p>挾著2023年香港小姐季軍頭銜入行，當年參選時已有翻版范冰冰稱號，當選後她並未選擇留在香港發展，反而決定回到北京中央戲劇學院繼續完成學業。在求學階段期間她已經獲得大量工作機會，先後參與《雨霖鈴》、《諜報上不封頂》以及《閃耀如她》等多套內地大型劇集拍攝工作。直到最近她正式宣告畢業，隨即全身投入演藝圈大展拳腳，事業發展備受外界看好。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚惹火完美身材猶如人間胸器</h2>\n<p>隨著性感日落短片在網絡上瘋狂流傳，大批網民紛紛湧入其社交平台留言區發表激動感受。不少人對她深不可測傲人上圍感到驚訝，有網民直接大讚「近年最美的港姐了」、「美的好立體好高級」及「我認知裡的完美的有顏值有身材」。部分留言更聚焦於她極具反差感豐滿身段，激動直呼她為「人間胸器」，並形容其打扮「大方又慷慨」，成功在網絡上掀起極大迴響。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361440479018795_14724573166ae8624506d4e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港姐 今屆港姐三甲為冠軍莊子璇（中）、亞軍王怡然（左）及季軍王敏慈被質疑號召力不足。（圖片來源：東方新地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361440479018795_14724573166ae8624506d4e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>2023年港姐三甲為冠軍莊子璇（中）、亞軍王怡然（左）及季軍王敏慈被質疑號召力不足。（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/lovelle.minci_1763652867_3770115961673126168_1537141751_1125767852691fdedb5fddf-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港姐 台慶 （圖片來源：王敏慈IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/lovelle.minci_1763652867_3770115961673126168_1537141751_1125767852691fdedb5fddf-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：王敏慈IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82%e6%96%b0%e8%81%9e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂新聞</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b1%9f%e7%be%8e%e5%84%80/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">江美儀</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%8b%e6%95%8f%e6%85%88/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">王敏慈</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3534580\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 2 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:07.694942+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1451,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:13:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:18:37.381315+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:33.142287+00:00","content_hash":"fb601078cc5e7b57403539f3715c069615151292cb49866173e221315ab4084f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}